{"ID":"20240118151132-vpd3ith","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151132-vpd3ith","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151132-vpd3ith\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151132-wtipvhz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122130548-2vl0gj2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:243,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122130548-2vl0gj2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:416,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:416\u0026#125;","title":"188白薇","type":"doc","updated":"20240201103329"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151132-wtipvhz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151132-wtipvhz","updated":"20240122130445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，平，无毒。治暴中风，身热，肢满，忽忽不知人。狂惑，邪气，寒热，酸疼，温疟洒洒、发作有时。生平原、川谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130448-41qou74","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130448-41qou74"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产陕西及关外，生平原川谷间，茎叶俱青，根黄白色入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130450-agjv6io","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130450-agjv6io"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦咸，性平，无毒。阳明冲任之药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130452-hv7qijo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130452-hv7qijo"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】白薇为凉血退热要药，功能清虚火，除胃热，主治身热肢满，风温灼热，汗出热不退，妇人身热，伤中淋露。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130455-027fu2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130455-027fu2o"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗伤中淋露，下水气，利阴气，益精。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130457-jcs2aiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130457-jcs2aiu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【弘景】治惊邪风狂痣病，百邪鬼魅。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130456-461op33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130456-461op33"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本草】主治中风，身热支满，忽忽不知人，血虚，热淋，温疟，洗洗寒热酸痛。妇人伤中淋露，产虚烦呕。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130459-6l6i0d6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130459-6l6i0d6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130501-mpgp704","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130501-mpgp704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】恶大黄，大戟，山茱，姜枣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130445-vpij7x5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130445-vpij7x5"}},{"ID":"20240122130501-b7vv3ay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130501-b7vv3ay"}},{"ID":"20240122130501-r3razl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130501-r3razl5","updated":"20240201103040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那再来呢，这个叫做白薇，白薇就长这个样子，这是白薇。白薇这个药呢，是《神农本草经》里面凉血退热的药，诸位在读《神农本草经》的时候，“老师那么多药，常常重复，然后这个不容易记起来”。不容易记起来是正常噢，没有关系，因为我们后面讲处方的时候，增加药进来的时候，你看多了就会了。以后你不要刻意的记它，刻意去背它，反而会忘掉，你用多了，自然而然记进去，是永远不会忘。所以你记不得不要慌，不要紧张，我们没有考试不要担心。对啊，我考我自己，到时候给你们看，带你们临床给你们看噢。"}]},{"ID":"20240122130542-i1e0otp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130542-i1e0otp","updated":"20240201103111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个白薇呢，它本身是凉血能够退热的药，那这个使用的时机呢，诸位看本草经的原文写的，他说“突然这个人中风啊，身热支满，手脚都涨满，忽忽，突然不知道人，不识人，或者这个狂惑，人都认不清楚了”。性味是苦咸。苦味的药能够泻，能够坚。咸味的药能够攻，能够软坚，性平无毒，阳明、冲脉、任脉的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240122130548-2vl0gj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130548-2vl0gj2","updated":"20240201103329"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位很少看到这个，他会写这个是哪条经。这里特别注明了，冲、任的药物。主治：凉血退热，最主要是里面，这个我们所谓凉血，为什我们会要去凉血？当你血太热的时候，血会往上一直冲，冲到脸上整个红了，中医叫血热。那你看老师那个人脸上涨得红红的那是血热，我们要靠凉血的药。中医可能这样讲。西医可能会说你看他血压冲到，整个冲到脑部去人快昏厥过去了，能把血压降下去——白薇。但是我们不用西医的话来讲，因为有的人脸上没有红也是血压高啊，所以如果你定名以后就不好了，哦老师以后只要血压高就用白薇，你错了，他不是对每一种都有用，对那种脸涨红得很厉害的人效果最好。血热。那普通呢，一般来说我们的一钱到三两钱都可以，你看，本草上面说，《本草纲目》说中风、不知人，不识人统统可以使用它，因为他能够把血热降下来，那凉血的针刺手法，比如我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"百会放血，十宣放血，针下涌泉穴，人中都是凉血的方式。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以治疗中风的处方里面，大家可以放白薇。抱歉哦，白薇是188，更正一下。"}]}]}